  "body": "If room names can accept variables (especially %me% and %them%, and less importantly %you%), it would be possible to have rooms such as '%them% - work' vs. '%them% - private', which would translate into significant names on all sides.\r\n\r\nSee the discussion [here](https://github.com/vector-im/element-web/issues/8211) for more info.",
